{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55611","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 九 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽斋独坐绝参详，兀尔何如骤世忙。\n拯济终凭宏愿力，安闲须得守愚方。\n柴门半掩花空落，苔径虚踪草自荒。\n最好静中无一事，翛然唯得道芽长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}